full-query: "A company has strict security policies. For its AWS services, special attention is required to ensure that there is no security vulnerability. You are asked to set up a rule in AWS Config to inspect if the AWS resources are always as expected. The rule is very complicated, and there is no existing AWS managed rule that can meet the company's needs. Which actions in combinations can achieve this requirement? (Select TWO.)"
